{"Title":"An Act relative to erecting a bench in honor of Rita Walsh in the Hyde Park neighborhood of Boston","BillNumber":"H3965","DocketNumber":"HD4368","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"R_C1","Name":"Rob Consalvo","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/R_C1","ResponseDate":"2023-05-30T14:32:00.677"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"R_C1","Name":"Rob Consalvo","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/R_C1","ResponseDate":"2023-05-30T14:32:00.6766667"},{"Id":"MFR0","Name":"Michael F. Rush","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MFR0","ResponseDate":"2023-11-27T11:31:26.1266667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3965/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Consalvo of Boston, a petition (subject to Joint Rule 12) of Rob Consalvo that the Department of Conservation and Recreation be authorized to erect a bench in the Hyde Park neighborhood of the city of Boston in honor of Rita Walsh.  Environment and Natural Resources.","DocumentText":"\tThe department of conservation and recreation shall erect and maintain a bench at the property, which is under the care and control of the department, located at the intersection of Beacon street, Truman parkway and Fairmount avenue in the Hyde Park section of the city of Boston in honor of Rita Walsh for her many years of dedicated service to the neighborhood of Hyde Park. The department shall affix to the bench a suitable plaque bearing the designation in accordance with the standards of the department.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Suspend Rules","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H33","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H33"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J21","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J21"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Correctly Drawn","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H36","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H36"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"S29","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/S29"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}